{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一段大号白色粗体文字最先进入视线，随后中部第二段蓝色竖线旁的大号白字也很容易争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他在一阵高兴之后，开始渴望对方给出不会改变的保证。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"渴望确定感、隐约不安，害怕失去的意味初步可见。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他具体害怕对方有一天不再需要自己，因此想把已经流露的喜欢藏回去；但实际上真要收回喜欢，自己反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三段字号和亮度相近的大字都很突出，主视线容易在几块之间分散。\",\n    \"每段都是较长的句子，内部包含转折和多层意思，需要读完整才能准确理解。\",\n    \"核心处境和完整的情绪关系分散在三段文字里，需要拼接才能理解。\",\n    \"每段下方还有一组较小的短语，增加了额外的扫读选择。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4662e5f9-19ba-4ed4-a4b6-c9be0d1a2907", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T032905710359Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:29:30.845991+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "534b391ac950179e5a4b4273a11ffc91655cf5a521c9a09bb2271920bf2bdd3e", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa